WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Kneel in Thunderbolt (or sit on a block between the heels).

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Inhale and raise both arms overhead.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Exhale and fold forward, bringing the forehead toward the knees or the floor.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Arms stretch forward or rest alongside the legs — choose what feels quieter.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Rise on an inhale and sit tall again.
